  "The Checkout Attachment Module for eCommerceGo introduces a streamlined way for customers to add attachments during the checkout process. This module empowers customers to include essential documents or files related to their orders, such as design specifications, proof of identity, or personalized instructions. By allowing attachments at checkout, the module enhances the clarity and accuracy of orders, ensuring that all necessary information is captured upfront.": "El módulo de archivos adjuntos de pago para eCommerceGo presenta una forma simplificada para que los clientes agreguen archivos adjuntos durante el proceso de pago. ",
